{"id":"5c268cc9a199d00a","group":"92","path":"92/92-lem-derivability-conditions.md","title":"Derivability Conditions","display":"lem-derivability-conditions — Derivability Conditions","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-lem-derivability-conditions","aliases":["92-lem-derivability-conditions"],"display":"lem-derivability-conditions — Derivability Conditions","depends_on":["[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-df-g-system]]","[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-provable]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-lem-derivability-conditions"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-lem-derivability-conditions</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-derivability-conditions — Derivability Conditions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (standard internal provability-formula constructor, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (sentences, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (the fixed recursively axiomatized PA system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n(D1);&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr),\\\\\n(D2);&amp;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))\\Bigr),\\\\\n(D3);&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n(D1);&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr),\\\\\n(D2);&amp;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))\\Bigr),\\\\\n(D3);&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D1, D2, D3\">\\(D1, D2, D3\\)</span> : 可推导条件</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D1\">\\(D1\\)</span> : 如果<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可证，则“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>可证”可证；两项都是元语言中的可导性判断，所以连接它们的是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Longrightarrow\">\\(\\Longrightarrow\\)</span>而非对象语言<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\">\\(\\to\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D2\">\\(D2\\)</span> : 可证性分配到蕴涵</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D3\">\\(D3\\)</span> : 可证性的内化</li>\n<li>这里的结论针对本书固定的PA系统及其标准证明谓词；任意形式系统并不自动满足这些条件</li>\n<li>GL公理与这些条件相关</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-g-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"51c43e0240787ebb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (standard internal provability-formula constructor, see [[92-df-provability-predicate]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (sentences, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-g-system","status":"resolved","id":"e0eabee5d77258a7","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G$ (the fixed recursively axiomatized PA system, see [[92-df-g-system]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"b78092e29a02d697","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\bar n$ (numeral for $n$, see [[92-df-numeral]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}derivability\\text{-}conditions}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n(D1);&\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(G\\vdash\\varphi\\Longrightarrow\nG\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\bigr),\\\\\n(D2);&\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\to\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\to(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner}))\\Bigr),\\\\\n(D3);&\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\nG\\vdash\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\to\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\urcorner})\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D1, D2, D3","display":false},{"tex":"D1","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Longrightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\to","display":false},{"tex":"D2","display":false},{"tex":"D3","display":false}],"bytes":2005,"backlinks":[{"id":"f29382efb1ab3219","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"603b78700e219950","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""